via and Republic of Poland, were conducted as a coalition without distinction between them. The focus of activities attempted to affect modernization of the U.S. Visa Waiver Program (VWP), including work on S. 4 and H.R. 1543. Monies received for the six month period ending November 30, 2007 in the amount of $213,539.04 are reported under the Czech Republic's registration. This total amount also covers the remaining six foreign principals registered by DUTKO. The registrant also performed services such as research, education and information collection on behalf of the foreign principals. Finances: None Reported","source":"fara-2007-2","locator":"PDF p. 205; amount p. 205","page":205,"amountPage":205,"registration":"5804","duplicateOf":null,"review":"structured-extraction","periodText":"None Reported","cashVerified":false},{"id":"fara-2016-1-p188-r6297-0-0-0","country":"SK","origin":"SLOVAKIA","category":"media","measure":"fara-receipts","amount":null,"year":null,"periodEnd":null,"periodMonths":null,"reportYear":2016,"reportHalf":1,"recipient":"Signal Group Consulting, LLC","principal":"Embassy of the Slovak Republic","governmentSource":null,"services":"Media Relations","description":"The registrant will provide media and communications strategy on behalf of the foreign principal. Finances: None Reported","source":"fara-2016-1","locator":"PDF p. 188; amount p. 188","page":188,"amountPage":188,"registration":"6297","duplicateOf":null,"review":"structured-extraction","periodText":"None Reported","cashVerified":false},{"id":"fara-2016-2-p195-r6297-0-0-0","country":"SK","origin":"SLOVAKIA","category":"media","measure":"fara-receipts","amount":49500.0,"year":2016,"periodEnd":"2016-12-31","periodMonths":6,"reportYear":2016,"reportHalf":2,"recipient":"Signal Group Consulting, LLC","principal":"Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Slovak Republic, Represented by the Embassy of the Slovak Republic","governmentSource":null,"services":"Media Relations","description":"The registra